{
  "name": "KDERP relay (Odoo -> KDERP JSON-RPC)",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "httpMethod": "POST",
        "path": "kderp-relay",
        "authentication": "headerAuth",
        "responseMode": "responseNode",
        "options": {}
      },
      "name": "Webhook",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.webhook",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        0,
        0
      ],
      "webhookId": "kderp-relay",
      "credentials": {
        "httpHeaderAuth": {
          "id": "CHANGE_ME",
          "name": "KDERP relay token (header X-Relay-Token)"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "={{ $json.headers['x-target-url'] }}/jsonrpc",
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={{ JSON.stringify($json.body) }}",
        "options": {
          "timeout": 300000
        }
      },
      "name": "Forward to KDERP",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        260,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "respondWith": "firstIncomingItem",
        "options": {}
      },
      "name": "Respond",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.respondToWebhook",
      "typeVersion": 1.1,
      "position": [
        520,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## KDERP relay\nThe ONLY n8n workflow Odoo needs. It forwards the JSON-RPC body that Odoo sends to `<X-Target-URL>/jsonrpc` and returns KDERP's answer. No logic: which jobs, fields and rates are decided in Odoo, so this never changes.\n\n1. Create a *Header Auth* credential: name `X-Relay-Token`, value = a long random token, and select it on **Webhook**.\n2. Activate the workflow.\n3. In Odoo: Settings > Remote Server Connection > Relay: URL = the *Production URL* of **Webhook**, token = the same value; Server = the KDERP URL (sent as X-Target-URL).\n\nNote: the target is taken from the header, so anyone with the token can make n8n call any URL it can reach. Keep the token secret; for a stricter relay, add an IF node that only allows your KDERP host.",
        "height": 330,
        "width": 520
      },
      "name": "Note",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        0,
        -380
      ]
    }
  ],
  "connections": {
    "Webhook": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Forward to KDERP",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Forward to KDERP": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Respond",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    }
  },
  "settings": {
    "executionOrder": "v1"
  }
}